  "description": "Recurring and delayed workflow starts for Sagant. A schedule is itself a workflow,\n      so it inherits durability, retries, visibility and the deadline machinery rather than\n      reimplementing them — and it runs on any Sagant runtime, since it depends on the core package\n      alone.",
